3. Inherited Code (from illogical-impulse / dots-hyprland)
-----------------------------------------------------------
The following originate from illogical-impulse (end-4/dots-hyprland) and are
included largely unmodified as the base dotfiles layer:

- Base Hyprland configuration structure (~/.config/hypr/)
- Base Quickshell module architecture (the "ii" runtime namespace)
- Core services: Config, Appearance, Directories, FileUtils, Translation
- System integration: Hyprland keybinds, rules, window management
- Scripts under dots/.config/quickshell/flow/scripts/ (colors, hyprland, ai, etc.)
- Widget framework (AbstractBackgroundWidget, widget extensions)
- Settings framework (ConfigSwitch, ConfigSelectionArray, etc.)

Original copyright: end-4 (dots-hyprland)
License: GPL-3.0

