4. External Projects (Dependencies)
-----------------------------------
The following external projects are used as dependencies (not embedded):

- Quickshell (https://quickshell.org/) — Widget system, LGPL-3.0
- Hyprland (https://hyprland.com/) — Compositor, BSD-3-Clause
- Matugen (https://github.com/matugen/matugen) — Material You color generation, MIT
- Material Icons / Material Symbols — Google Fonts, Apache-2.0
- Various system tools: hyprctl, hyprpaper, hyprlock, sddm, etc.

